//spirebird.com/card.html?id=FIEND_FIRE&amp;resetRules=all\" aria-label=\"Fiend Fire on Spirebird\" title=\"Fiend Fire · Spirebird\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">spirebird.com\u003c/a>\u003c/footer>\n  \u003c/div>\n  \u003csection class=\"detail-tier-section\" id=\"detail-fiend_fire-tier-comment\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"detail-fiend_fire-tier-comment-title\" hidden>\u003cheader class=\"tier-popup-header\">\u003ch3 id=\"detail-fiend_fire-tier-comment-title\">\u003cspan class=\"tier-popup-name\" lang=\"en\">Fiend Fire\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"detail-creator-rating\" data-author=\"Jorbs\">\u003cspan class=\"creator-tier-badge\" data-tier=\"S\" style=\"--creator-tier-color:rgb(225, 112, 132)\" aria-label=\"Jorbs Tier S\">S\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003c/header>\u003cp class=\"detail-tier-comment\" lang=\"en\">Lots of damage, very quickly, and chances to benefit from exhaust synergies like Feel No Pain. Goes especially well with ways to fill up your hand like Battle Trance or Offering. It&#39;s also an excellent target for some game-winning enchants, like 8 Vigor or +50% damage.\u003cbr>\u003cbr>Taking it most of the time is the right idea, but do be careful in decks which are dependent on particular cards and will regret playing it when they draw it.\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"detail-tier-translation\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">很快就會造成大量傷害，並且有機會從「感覺無痛」等排氣協同效應中受益。特別適用於諸如戰鬥恍惚或奉獻之類的補充手牌的方法。它也是一些贏得遊戲的附魔的絕佳目標，例如 8 活力或 +50% 傷害。\u003cbr>\u003cbr>大多數時候使用它是正確的想法，但在依賴特定牌的套牌中要小心，並且在抽到它時會後悔玩它。\u003c/p>\u003ca class=\"detail-tier-source\" href=\"https://sts2.untapped.gg/en/tier-list/6b3390b7-bcbc-4ebc-ae78-ae9a400c66dc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jorbs Ironclad Tier List\u003c/a>\u003c/section>\n\u003c/article>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr id=\"card-HELLRAISER\" role=\"row\" data-name=\"hellraiser 地獄狂徒\" data-id=\"HELLRAISER\" data-search=\"地獄狂徒dhellraiser character type power rarity rare ➕︎ 2 whenever you draw a card containing “strike”, it is played against a random enemy. 1 whenever you draw a card containing “strike”, it is played against a random enemy. untapped.ggspirebird.com hellraiserd i think hellraiser is occasionally a &quot;good&quot; pickup if you have a few pommel strikes in your deck, and those aren&#39;t awful to take early on in the run, so i could see it happening. if you can exhaust your deck down to a couple of pommel strikes with hellraiser in play they loop for a long time until hopefully all of the enemies are dead. probably not usually worth picking up, though. 我認為，如果你的套牌中有一些鞍馬打擊，那麼《猛鬼追魂》偶爾會是一個「不錯的」選擇，而且在比賽初期接受這些打擊並不可怕，所以我可以看到它的發生。如果你能用盡你的套牌，在《地獄使者》在場時進行幾次鞍擊，它們就會循環很長一段時間，直到希望所有敵人都死掉為止。不過，通常可能不值得購買。 jorbs ironclad tier list\" data-type=\"Power\" data-rarity=\"Rare\" class=\"card-detail-row\" data-base-energy=\"2\" data-cost-down=\"true\" data-energy-gain=\"false\" data-sort-values=\"{}\" data-tier=\"C\">\u003ctd class=\"card-detail-cell\" data-field=\"detail\" role=\"cell\" colspan=\"10\">\u003carticle class=\"card-detail\" data-card-layout=\"compact\" data-catalog-layout=\"true\" data-effect-version=\"base\" aria-labelledby=\"detail-hellraiser-title\" lang=\"en\" data-source=\"https://slaythespire2.net/card/hellraiser\" data-character=\"Ironclad\">\n  \u003cdiv class=\"detail-overview\">\n    \u003cfigure class=\"detail-art\" data-detail-row=\"1\">\u003cimg src=\"assets/cards/source/cards/ironclad/hellraiser.webp\" width=\"700\" height=\"532\" alt=\"Hellraiser illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\u003c/figure>\n    \u003cheader>\u003ch2 class=\"detail-title\" id=\"detail-hellraiser-title\">\u003cspan class=\"detail-title-row\">\u003cspan class=\"detail-name-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">地獄狂徒\u003c/span>\u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"detail-tier-trigger\" data-card-tier=\"detail-hellraiser-tier-comment\" aria-label=\"Open Tier commentary\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"detail-hellraiser-tier-comment\">\u003cspan class=\"det